  "description": "XUGJUG crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C244 H328 N14 O49 P4 Pr10 2+,C88 H110 O8 2-,2(C3 H7 N1 O1),2(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Pr1 (Pr) has 8 O neighbors; Pr2 (Pr) has 8 O neighbors; Pr3 (Pr) has 9 O neighbors; Pr4 (Pr) has 8 O neighbors; Pr5A (Pr) has 7 O neighbors; Pr6 (Pr) has 8 O neighbors; Pr7 (Pr) has 8 O neighbors; Pr8 (Pr) has 9 O neighbors; Pr9 (Pr) has 8 O neighbors; Pr10 (Pr) has 7 O neighbors; Pr5B? (Pr) has 0 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 21 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.819-5.623 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 86.44-180.00°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Pr10(TBC8A)2(PhPO3)4(OH)2(HCO3)(HCOO)(DMF)14]·(H6TBC8A)·2DMF·2CH3OH. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula). Article name explicitly identifies I(II).",
